program	exclusivity_var_self_receiver.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: `c` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `c` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/exclusivity_var_self_receiver.saw:19:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 19 |     c.mix(&c)"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: disjoint access paths are allowed (e.g. `&var p.x` with `&p.y`); give the mutable reference exclusive access"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
